            "source:b4fb00670c3dff3fdb9a9275"
          ],
          "text": "A Deadwind ogre mage is a humanoid combatant that uses Lightning Shield outside combat and Lightning Bolt and Bloodlust in combat, including Bloodlust when badly hurt.",
